Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.94,0:00:22.49,Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HBB}ecchira ochira sa   kamome no nakigoe kikitsutsu
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.49,0:00:26.99,Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HBB}donbura donbura to   nami ni yurare yuku shima wa
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.99,0:00:28.58,Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HBB}okaruto airando
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.58,0:00:31.71,Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HBB}takanaru kokoro mo osaezu...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.71,0:00:36.32,Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HBB}yorokobi ga unaru! chishikiyoku kamishimete!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.72,0:00:45.22,Romaji,,0,0,0,,nandomo nandomo sa   noroi no shomotsu yomiasatte mo
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.22,0:00:49.85,Romaji,,0,0,0,,dou ni mo kou ni mo ne   wakannee koto bakari aru
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.85,0:00:51.52,Romaji,,0,0,0,,...ga! Goodbye nayami!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.52,0:00:54.48,Romaji,,0,0,0,,sayounara hikikomori no hibi
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.48,0:00:59.16,Romaji,,0,0,0,,nengan no nazo no kotou ni tadoritsuita!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.57,0:01:08.28,Romaji,,0,0,0,,kaidoku dekita watashi nomi wo yurusu hiroma wa
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.28,0:01:09.87,Romaji,,0,0,0,,nantomo mabayui...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.87,0:01:12.71,Romaji,,0,0,0,,doko kashiko mo ougon! ougon!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.71,0:01:17.29,Romaji,,0,0,0,,Yahoo! Pa Pa Ya! Ah...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.29,0:01:22.01,Romaji,,0,0,0,,kindan no etsuraku de aru to shirinagara
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.14,0:01:38.15,Romaji,,0,0,0,,(null sieben fünfzehn elf neunundzwanzig)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.37,0:01:53.83,Romaji,,0,0,0,,dongara byunbyun to   iya na oto ga kikoete kuru
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.83,0:01:58.34,Romaji,,0,0,0,,masaka masaka na   dare mo inai hazu na no ni
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.34,0:02:00.05,Romaji,,0,0,0,,kono shima nan nan sa...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.05,0:02:03.01,Romaji,,0,0,0,,wakideru fuan o yosome ni
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.01,0:02:07.64,Romaji,,0,0,0,,ashidori wa oku e oku e to hikikomarete...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.22,0:02:13.81,Romaji,,0,0,0,,konjiki chouchou ni
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.81,0:02:16.83,Romaji,,0,0,0,,matowaritsuku nanatsu no kui
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.83,0:02:18.44,Romaji,,0,0,0,,bureedo ni bariyaa ni
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.44,0:02:21.23,Romaji,,0,0,0,,akai moji yara aoi moji...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.23,0:02:25.90,Romaji,,0,0,0,,konrinzai yameta! sayounara okaruto no shima yo
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.90,0:02:30.41,Romaji,,0,0,0,,mou nido to tachiiru koto wa shimasen kara...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.08,0:02:38.42,Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HBB}tojikomerarete chibiru watashi
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.42,0:02:39.63,Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HBB}sakebu kotoba ga...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.63,0:02:41.29,Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HBB}koko wa doko?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.29,0:02:44.13,Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HBB}majo darake no hentai kuukan?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.13,0:02:48.68,Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HBB}Oh No! My God... Ha...!!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.68,0:02:53.43,Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HBB}densetsu wa usan no mi to tomo ni kakusarete
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.57,0:03:09.24,Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HBB}(null sieben fünfzehn elf neunundzwanzig)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.94,0:00:22.49,Translation,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HBB}Chugging and chuffing along the ocean listening to cries of seagulls
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.49,0:00:26.99,Translation,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HBB}Rolling and roiling waves rocking the boat I’m sailing to the isle
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.99,0:00:28.58,Translation,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HBB}Island of the occult
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.58,0:00:31.71,Translation,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HBB}My mind is racing and my heart is thumping...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.71,0:00:36.32,Translation,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HBB}Surging ecstasy! Savoring the taste of curiosity!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.72,0:00:45.22,Translation,,0,0,0,,Time after time after time   I studied the contents of the cursed grimoires
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.22,0:00:49.85,Translation,,0,0,0,,Mulled over page after page   The whole thing nothing but gobbledegook
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.85,0:00:51.52,Translation,,0,0,0,,...But! Goodbye, worrying!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.52,0:00:54.48,Translation,,0,0,0,,And adios to my days of inside living
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.48,0:00:59.16,Translation,,0,0,0,,I am here at last, standing on the shore of an isle of mystery!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.57,0:01:08.28,Translation,,0,0,0,,Only one who cracks the code can enter this spacious room and
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.28,0:01:09.87,Translation,,0,0,0,,Gosh, how bright it shines...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.87,0:01:12.71,Translation,,0,0,0,,There and everywhere is gold and more gold!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.71,0:01:17.29,Translation,,0,0,0,,Yahoo! Pa Pa Ya! Ah...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.29,0:01:22.01,Translation,,0,0,0,,Knowing all along that this is the fruit of a forbidden paradise
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.14,0:01:38.15,Translation,,0,0,0,,(zero seven fifteen eleven twenty-nine)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.37,0:01:53.83,Translation,,0,0,0,,Clash clatter zip swish thunk   Dreadful noises are coming from somewhere
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.83,0:01:58.34,Translation,,0,0,0,,Must be mistaken, I think   There shouldn’t be anybody here but me
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.34,0:02:00.05,Translation,,0,0,0,,What is this island’s deal...?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.05,0:02:03.01,Translation,,0,0,0,,Pretending not to notice worry rising,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.01,0:02:07.64,Translation,,0,0,0,,I followed the noise and let myself be drawn in deeper, deeper still...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.22,0:02:13.81,Translation,,0,0,0,,Golden butterfly breed
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.81,0:02:16.83,Translation,,0,0,0,,Septuple stakes that clatter round at high speed
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.83,0:02:18.44,Translation,,0,0,0,,Blades and barriers lead
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.44,0:02:21.23,Translation,,0,0,0,,To red text and even blue to read
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.23,0:02:25.90,Translation,,0,0,0,,Yep, screw this, I am out! Goodbye forever, you occultic island
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.90,0:02:30.41,Translation,,0,0,0,,You can bet your life I will never dare to set foot here again...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.08,0:02:38.42,Translation,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HBB}But fear strikes, I’m trapped in here
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.42,0:02:39.63,Translation,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HBB}And the words I shout out are,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.63,0:02:41.29,Translation,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HBB}“Where on Earth am I?!”
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.29,0:02:44.13,Translation,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HBB}“A perverted region packed with witches?!”
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.13,0:02:48.68,Translation,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HBB}Oh No! My God... Ha...!!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.68,0:02:53.43,Translation,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HBB}Then the legend’s lost, hidden alongside a very fishy fruit
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.57,0:03:09.24,Translation,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HBB}(zero seven fifteen eleven twenty-nine)
